  "releaseNotes": "- Added a reusable Web API execution helper (RSEndpointWebApiHelper) with per-endpoint options to reduce boilerplate around WCF calls.\n\t\t  - Introduced RSEndpointExecutionOptions to enable/disable header context usage (RSEndpointHeaderContext.Use) and response header injection independently (supports anonymous calls without TokenSID/If-None-Match).\n\t\t  - Added optional 304 Not Modified handling for WebApi endpoints that return DTOs, ensuring the pipeline is short-circuited via HttpResponseException and preventing 304 from being serialized back as 200.\n\t\t  - Improved ETag propagation for caching scenarios, including Access-Control-Expose-Headers: ETag support for JavaScript clients.",
  "title": "DVO.Core",
